{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1367","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1367/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1367/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1367/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1367","id":3327989560,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7GXRc4","number":1367,"title":"Linux Version Support for Trae AI","user":{"login":"rakibulrocky14","id":187338211,"node_id":"U_kgDOCyqN4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187338211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14","html_url":"https://github.com/rakibulrocky14","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rakibulrocky14/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":23,"created_at":"2025-08-17T05:47:23Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T08:22:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"🚀 Feature Request: Linux Version Support\n\n👋 Hey Trae AI team,\n\nI'm Rakibul, an AI & Python developer and a huge fan of Trae AI Editor! 💻\nI've been using your AI-powered IDE for coding and debugging, and it has significantly enhanced my productivity with its intelligent code generation, refactoring, and auto-completion capabilities.\n\nHowever, Trae AI currently lacks official support for Linux, which is a major limitation for me and many other developers.\n\n🔥 Why Linux Support Matters:\nGrowing Linux Community:\n\nA large portion of the developer community uses Linux for programming, server management, and development environments.\nNative Linux support will expand your user base significantly.\nPerformance and Stability:\n\nRunning Trae AI on Linux natively (without Wine) will provide better performance, stability, and resource efficiency.\nLinux users often prioritize lightweight, efficient IDEs, making Trae AI a perfect fit.\nDemand from Developers:\n\nMany Linux users are actively requesting support.\nA native Linux build would make Trae more accessible and widely adopted.\n\n🛠️ Potential Benefits:\nSSH Remote Support → Easier remote server management.\nCLI Mode → Faster performance on Linux terminals.\nLow-RAM Compatibility → Better performance on low-memory machines.\n\n✅ Request Details:\nTarget Platforms: Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Arch.\nPackaging Formats: .deb, .AppImage, .tar.gz for easier installation.\nOptional CLI Mode: Ability to run in terminal mode for low-resource usage.\n\n🌟 Conclusion:\nAs a 18-year-old AI developer working on large-scale projects, Linux support would significantly improve my workflow.\nI genuinely believe Trae AI on Linux would benefit a massive developer community.\n\n✨ Thank you for creating such an amazing product, and I hope you'll consider adding Linux support soon! 🚀\n\nBest regards,\nRakibul Islam","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI